{
  "file": "module3",
  "page": 99,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        68.89222717285156,
        200.08187866210938,
        85.3282241821289
      ],
      "text": "2.4.2 First-line LPAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        95.56519317626953,
        526.9260864257812,
        108.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "In 2008, WHO approved the use of commercial LPAs for detecting MTBC in combination with",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        111.06519317626953,
        526.6622924804688,
        124.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid in sputum smear-positive specimens (direct testing)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        126.56519317626953,
        526.93701171875,
        139.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "and in cultured isolates of MTBC (indirect testing). A systematic review at that time evaluated",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.065185546875,
        526.9529418945312,
        155.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "the diagnostic accuracy of two commercially available LPAs – the INNO-LiPA Rif.TB assay",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.565185546875,
        526.954833984375,
        170.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "(Innogenetics, Ghent, Belgium), and the GenoType® MTBDR  (version 1), hereafter referred  plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.992096900939941,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        173.065185546875,
        526.9815673828125,
        186.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "to as Hain version 1 – and provided evidence for WHO’s endorsement  . Excellent accuracy  (37, 38)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.94486141204834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        188.565185546875,
        526.9810791015625,
        201.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "was reported for both tests in detecting rifampicin resistance, but their diagnostic accuracy",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        204.065185546875,
        526.9645385742188,
        217.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "for isoniazid resistance had lower sensitivity, despite the high specificity. Because there were",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.565185546875,
        526.69384765625,
        232.71018981933594
      ],
      "text": "inadequate data to allow stratification by smear status, WHO’s recommendation for using",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        235.065185546875,
        526.9151000976562,
        248.21018981933594
      ],
      "text": "LPAs was limited to culture isolates or smear-positive sputum specimens. Further data have",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        250.565185546875,
        526.9646606445312,
        263.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "since been published on the use of LPAs; newer versions of LPA technology have now been",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.065185546875,
        526.88818359375,
        279.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "developed, such as the Hain GenoType MTBDR  version 2, hereafter referred to as Hain  plus",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        281.565185546875,
        526.9808959960938,
        294.710205078125
      ],
      "text": "version 2; and other manufacturers have entered the market, including Nipro (Tokyo, Japan),",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.065185546875,
        477.3320007324219,
        310.210205078125
      ],
      "text": "which developed the Genoscholar™ NTM+MDRTB II, hereafter referred to as Nipro.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        321.0691223144531,
        527.26708984375,
        334.2141418457031
      ],
      "text": "In 2015, FIND evaluated the Nipro and the Hain version 2 LPAs, and compared them with Hain",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 10.997349739074707,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        336.5691223144531,
        526.9259643554688,
        349.7141418457031
      ],
      "text": "version 1. The study demonstrated equivalence among the three commercially available LPAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        352.0691223144531,
        372.72271728515625,
        365.2141418457031
      ],
      "text": "for detecting TB and resistance to rifampicin and isoniazid  . (5)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        379.85540771484375,
        267.37811279296875,
        393.9433898925781
      ],
      "text": "Table 2.4.2.1 Class criteria for LPAs",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Bd",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
