      ],
      "text": "temperature requirements for storage.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.06689453125,
        483.7986145019531,
        486.1064147949219,
        496.9436340332031
      ],
      "text": "Skills Advanced technical skills (i.e., multiple sample or reagent",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204.59449768066406,
        496.7986145019531,
        507.71051025390625,
        509.9436340332031
      ],
      "text": "handling steps, precision pipetting, molecular workflows may",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204.59449768066406,
        509.798583984375,
        265.23748779296875,
        522.943603515625
      ],
      "text": "be required)",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.06689453125,
        529.93701171875,
        502.4028625488281,
        543.08203125
      ],
      "text": "Pipetting Multiple precision pipetting steps required by the procedure.",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.06689453125,
        550.0755004882812,
        474.3693542480469,
        563.2205200195312
      ],
      "text": "Testing  May require multiple specimen treatment steps before",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        145.06689453125,
        563.0755004882812,
        517.0162963867188,
        576.2205200195312
      ],
      "text": "Procedure transferring the specimen into a sealed container for multi-step",
      "font": "FrutigerNeueLT-Lt",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        204.59449768066406,
        576.0755004882812,
        241.20249938964844,
        589.2205200195312
      ],
      "text": "testing.",
